    formula = "MgO2",
    M = 0.056303);
  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Magnesium peroxide is a magnesium compound classified as an antacid and as an osmotically acting laxative, so it has been used for acid-related disorders and constipation. It is listed as experimental, with no authorised marketing identified, so its current clinical use is unclear.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q419379\">Wikidata Q419379</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>magnesium peroxide</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>A02AA03, A06AD03</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=\"https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB13486\">DB13486</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:81304\">81304</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q419379\">Q419379</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>MgO2</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>56.303 g/mol (knowledgebase (DrugBank calculated))</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
end MagnesiumPeroxide;
